OL,3,GNEWSA'I shoplifted to fuel drug habit'
OL,4,Asays reformed thief
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I shoplifted to fuel my drug habit,"
OL,7,Fsays one reformed thief, who now works
OL,8,Fto help rehabilitate people in similar
OL,9,Fsituations.
OL,11,FRoxy, 46, from Preston, said she began
OL,12,Fstealing items when she was still in
OL,13,Fprimary school and became a prolific
OL,14,Fshoplifter in adulthood - describing
OL,15,Fstealing as easy - before some support
OL,16,Fshe received while on probation helped
OL,17,Fher turn her life around.
OL,19,F"You're sat there with nothing: you've
OL,20,Fno options - you're going to steal and
OL,21,Fthat's not saying it's right," she told
OL,22,FBBC Radio Lancashire.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
