OL,3,GNEWSA'I shoplifted to fuel drug habit'
OL,4,Asays reformed thief
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn 2025, more than 9,500 shoplifting
OL,7,Fincidents were recorded in Lancashire -
OL,8,Fwith the highest number of incidents
OL,9,Ftaking place in Burnley, according to
OL,10,Fofficial data.
